@startuml
title Borehole ML Project - Risk Heatmap

skinparam backgroundColor white

rectangle "RISK HEATMAP\nLikelihood vs Impact" {

  rectangle "LOW IMPACT" as L
  rectangle "MEDIUM IMPACT" as M
  rectangle "HIGH IMPACT" as H

  rectangle "HIGH LIKELIHOOD" as HL
  rectangle "MEDIUM LIKELIHOOD" as ML
  rectangle "LOW LIKELIHOOD" as LL

  rectangle "R1\nInsufficient labelled data" as R1 #FF6666
  rectangle "R2\nModel validation failure" as R2 #FF6666
  rectangle "R3\nDeadline pressure" as R3 #FFCC66
  rectangle "R4\nData privacy breach" as R4 #FF6666
  rectangle "R5\nSystem downtime" as R5 #FFCC66
}

note bottom
Red: High priority
Amber: Medium priority
Actual likelihood and impact ratings must be reviewed against the risk register.
end note

@enduml
